                "description": "Completed two-set Venn diagram with a universal-set frame. No diagram outline is supplied in the student question.",
                "mathematics": "Latin only = 26 - 8 = 18; Greek only = 15 - 8 = 7; both = 8; neither = 50 - 18 - 8 - 7 = 17.",
                "answerVisibility": "Answer editions only."
              },
              "derived": false,
              "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
            }
          ]
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 16
      },
      {
        "id": "p16-q18-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "studies only Greek,",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
